# COVID-19 Data Analysis and Prediction (Python)

## 📌 Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing COVID-19 data using Python. The dataset was cleaned, processed, and visualized to identify trends and patterns. Machine learning techniques were also applied to predict outcomes and evaluate model performance.

## 🛠 Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn
- Jupyter Notebook

## 📊 Features
- Data Cleaning and Preprocessing
- Missing Values and Duplicate Check
- Data Visualization using Charts and Graphs
- Trend and Pattern Analysis
- Random Forest Model for Prediction
- Model Accuracy Evaluation

## 📈 Outcome
The project provides insights into COVID-19 trends through data analysis and visualization. A Random Forest model was used to make predictions and evaluate performance, helping understand patterns in the dataset.
